    "950": {
      "$value": "#000000",
      "$type": "color",
      "$description": "Added 2026-09-12, explicit request (collection sidebar, dark mode): \"make the sidebar darker than the surface... if there is no darker color in the tokens do one\" -- black.900 (bg.surface's own dark-theme value) was already the darkest primitive defined anywhere in this file, so there was genuinely nothing darker to reference. Pure black continues this ramp's own trend (each step's RGB channels step down by a roughly consistent amount from 50 to 900) to its natural floor, and is not a new hue -- shadow.low in Color-Base-Dark.json already uses literal rgb(0,0,0) directly, so pure black is already part of this system's vocabulary, just not yet named as a primitive step of its own."
    }
